{"suttaId":"tha-ap100","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5089,5107],"vripara":"45"},"segments":{"tha-ap100:0.3":"Senāsanadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap100:1.1":"“Siddhatthassa bhagavato, adāsiṃ paṇṇasantharaṃ;","tha-ap100:1.3":"Samantā upahārañca, kusumaṃ okiriṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap100:2.1":"“Pāsādevaṃ guṇaṃ rammaṃ [pāsāde ca guhaṃ rammaṃ (syā.)], anubhomi mahārahaṃ;","tha-ap100:2.3":"Mahagghāni ca pupphāni, sayanebhisavanti me.","tha-ap100:3.1":"“Sayanehaṃ tuvaṭṭāmi, vicitte pupphasanthate;","tha-ap100:3.3":"Pupphavuṭṭhi ca sayane, abhivassati tāvade.","tha-ap100:4.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, adāsiṃ paṇṇasantharaṃ;","tha-ap100:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, santharassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap100:5.1":"“Tiṇasantharakā nāma, sattete cakkavattino;","tha-ap100:5.3":"Ito te pañcame kappe, uppajjiṃsu janādhipā.","tha-ap100:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap100:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā senāsanadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap100:8.1":"Senāsanadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2786,"to":2786,"paras":[{"para":2786,"vripara":"45","refs":["tha-ap100:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto attano pubbacaritāpadānaṃ dassento <b>siddhatthassa bhagavato</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayattā uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap100:1"],["tha-ap100:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap100:1.1","siddhatthassa bhagavato",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
